1. [ ] Add authentication middleware to all routes except public ones
2. [ ] Move security settings to environment variables
3. [ ] Add Content-Type validation middleware
4. [ ] Configure CORS with explicit allowlist
5. [ ] Create role-based authorization for sensitive operations
6. [ ] Implement CSRF protection for state-changing operations
7. [ ] Add rate limiting to authentication endpoints specifically (e.g., login, password reset)
8. [ ] Ensure all environment variables are validated on startup

