**Why this is dangerous:**
- Even "canary" credentials in source code can accidentally be committed to version control
- Production credentials follow the same pattern, increasing likelihood of real secrets being exposed
- Can be used for credential stuffing attacks if discovered

**Recommendations:**
```javascript
// 1. Using environment variables properly (Recommended)
